The below is attributable to Principal Deputy Spokesperson Tommy Pigott:

Deputy Secretary of State Christopher Landau met with North Macedonia Foreign Minister Timčo Mucunski as part of the second U.S.-North Macedonia Strategic Dialogue in Washington, D.C. The meeting underscored the strong and growing partnership between the United States and North Macedonia and highlighted the two countries’ shared commitment to regional stability, economic cooperation, energy sector development, and NATO burden-sharing.